      "content": "9. Government of India Act 1858"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Lord Canning served as the Governor-General during the Revolt of 1857 and subsequently became the first Viceroy of India.",
        "Mangal Pandey of the 34th Native Infantry revolted at Barrackpore on March 29, 1857.",
        "The Government of India Act 1858 created the office of the Secretary of State for India and abolished the Board of Control and Court of Directors."
      ],
      "id": "djxrvsj"
